    "title": "Fest 22",
    "description": "Full schedule, lineup, and venue map for The FEST 22!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\nBROWSE THE FULL SCHEDULE\r\nStay in the loop and know what\u2019s going on at all times!\r\n\r\nSHARE YOUR SCHEDULE\r\nSave your schedule as perfectly sized photos for your social networks!\r\n\r\nMAKE YOUR OWN SCHEDULE\r\nGet a notification for each set you don\u2019t wanna miss!\r\n\r\nBROWSE THE LINEUP\r\nCheck out all 300+ BANDS, the FEST WRESTLING \u201cWE ARE FAMILY\u201d lineup, and the FEST COMEDY SHOWCASE!\r\n\r\nGET YOUR 3-DAY WRISTBAND FASTER\r\nGet a QR code for your ticket order to get through FEST Registration faster!\r\n\r\nMAPS\r\nDon\u2019t get lost stumblin\u2019 from venue to venue!\r\n\r\nNO DATA NEEDED\u2026 MOSTLY\r\nWorks entirely offline (besides schedule updates & mystery band drops)!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFollow us on Facebook, Twitter, and Instagram to check out official @thefestfl tweets and photos, AND don't forget to keep checking #fest22 activity to see what other FEST goers are up to! Be sure to check these throughout the weekend for MYSTERY BAND announcements and other last-minute news and surprises.\r\n\r\nE-mail steve@chilluminati-llc.com or tweet @chill_biz and @stephanwozniak for tech support, feedback, and any other nice things you have to say!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Full schedule, lineup, and venue map for The FEST 22!<br><br>FEATURES:<br><br>BROWSE THE FULL SCHEDULE<br>Stay in the loop and know what\u2019s going on at all times!<br><br>SHARE YOUR SCHEDULE<br>Save your schedule as perfectly sized photos for your social networks!<br><br>MAKE YOUR OWN SCHEDULE<br>Get a notification for each set you don\u2019t wanna miss!<br><br>BROWSE THE LINEUP<br>Check out all 300+ BANDS, the FEST WRESTLING \u201cWE ARE FAMILY\u201d lineup, and the FEST COMEDY SHOWCASE!<br><br>GET YOUR 3-DAY WRISTBAND FASTER<br>Get a QR code for your ticket order to get through FEST Registration faster!<br><br>MAPS<br>Don\u2019t get lost stumblin\u2019 from venue to venue!<br><br>NO DATA NEEDED\u2026 MOSTLY<br>Works entirely offline (besides schedule updates &amp; mystery band drops)!<br><br>---<br><br>Follow us on Facebook, Twitter, and Instagram to check out official @thefestfl tweets and photos, AND don&#39;t forget to keep checking #fest22 activity to see what other FEST goers are up to! Be sure to check these throughout the weekend for MYSTERY BAND announcements and other last-minute news and surprises.<br><br>E-mail steve@chilluminati-llc.com or tweet @chill_biz and @stephanwozniak for tech support, feedback, and any other nice things you have to say!",
